| `attendance_id` | PK |
| `enrollment_id` | FK |
| `attendance_date` | Único por `(enrollment_id, attendance_date)` |
| `attendance_status` | `present` / `absent` / `excused` |
| `notes` | |
| `recorded_by` | FK a `users` |

